So I was just trying some bit manipulation in C++. Here is what I tried:

int a = 1<<2;
cout<<a;

This gives the output as 4.

int a = 1<<3;
cout<<a;

This gives the output as 8

But when I do:

int a = 1<<2 + 1<<3;
cout<<a;

